WEBVTT

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.740
So school was canceled 
for the afternoon?

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:12.300
Oh, I seem to remember you spending a 
lot of time making lunch this morning.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.350
Did you make one for Taito-kun?

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.570
Huh? N-No!

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.340
I just happened to wake up early...

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:21.970
Haruka?

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.620
It's nothing like that.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.440
Did Taito eat the lunch I made?

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:49.420
Taito!

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.730
Damn!

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.230
That's three times?

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:56.230
What the hell is going on?!

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:02.960
Magic?

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:06.840
Yes, like the poison I gave you.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.590
Like yours? So, uh...

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:11.340
Vampire magic?

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.980
What does that mean?

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.050
I'm not sure.

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.030
But I know that it's dangerous.

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:19.920
I see...

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:25.230
Ten minutes until my 
death counter is reset.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.200
I'll have to make sure 
I don't die any more.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:28.950
Well...

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.080
Let's go back to the 
student council office.

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:31.610
Uh-huh.

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:33.900
I guess we'll have to ask

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:38.080
the royal pain-in-the-ass to 
explain what's going on here.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.310
Ta-da!

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.850
Hey! Didn't you hear 
me ta-da over here?!

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.850
Why are you ignoring me?!

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:08.020
Spell Error exorcises 
all kinds of power.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:10.760
But...

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:16.560
That sword is powerless 
against a certain foe.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.780
The angels who serve the Seraphim.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.870
Hey, Mirai.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:23.620
Hmm?

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.200
Have you heard of the Seraphim?

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.340
Nope!

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:46.470
I have a warning in case you're 
daft enough to keep her around.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.520
Beware the moon's encroachment.

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.520
Amusing.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:57.440
Hinata, you say it's impossible 
for me to tame Saitohimea?

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:00.340
I'm going to prove you wrong.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.290
Wh-Why are you kissing me?

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:05.950
Why are you kissing me?!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:06.770
Shut up.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.870
The curse is lifted!

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.500
Time for a fully charged Andu-Mirai!

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:18.500
The enemy's coming!

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.720
Was this also sent by the Seraphim?!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.270
It won't talk.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:26.850
Ballsy move.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.760
Whoa! This is crazy!

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:38.490
Hurry, Gekkou!

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.030
So people can survive inside.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.230
Well, I'll have a look then.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.580
Since I've been invited in.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:28.410
Damn Gekkou... Where'd he run off to?

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:31.680
There's something out there.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:37.750
"The Seraphim Yet Unsung"

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:33.980
Yes.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.060
Something really nasty.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:36.850
Uh-huh.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:37.730
Is it an enemy?

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.980
Well, I've been killed three times.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.050
It's clearly not a friend.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:55.960
What do we do?

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:59.280
We have to climb the stairs to 
reach the student council office...

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:01.940
You think we can win in a fight?

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:02.750
Huh?

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:04.840
Himea?

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.510
Wait! Where'd you go, Himea?!

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:10.720
Himea!

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:27.150
Stay back!

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.580
Damn...

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.330
That's four times...

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:44.460
Himea!

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.700
Stay back!

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.160
Don't come near me...

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.830
I don't want you to...

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:51.500
...see me like this...

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:53.650
I'm going to save you!

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.650
No... No... Don't...

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.430
Don't...

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:00.680
Stop...

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:04.260
You want me so badly...?

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.260
Himea!

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:12.410
I finally got to see Taito...

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.410
Don't take him...

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:16.850
Take him away again...

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:18.860
Yeah, I'll have you out 
of there in no time!

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:19.830
Taito!

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.590
Why...

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:39.470
That should do it.

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:40.600
Himea?

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.860
Saitohimea...

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:48.210
How could you fall in love 
with such a worthless human?

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:53.040
You abandoned me for this scum?

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:58.630
What's going on...?

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:01.280
You don't need to know!

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:07.150
You're not Himea!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.170
Taito...

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.180
Idiot.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:21.210
Now, he's died six times.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:24.670
If I kill him one more time, 
he won't come back to life.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:27.770
Stop...

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.690
Stop, Ba'alskra...

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.310
I'm leaving, Ba'alskra.

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:08.730
Are you in love with him?

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:11.880
Uh-huh...

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:15.350
Why him...

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:19.780
He's just a human.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:23.070
A foolish, weak human!

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:24.380
But...

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.780
But he isn't tarnished...

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:30.380
...the way we are...

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.980
You aren't tarnished!

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:34.670
You're too kind.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.530
You've always been kind to me...

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:40.360
But...

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:43.530
Look at my tarnished body...

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:51.020
Look at this tarnished body of mine...

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:59.760
I spent too much time alone...

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:04.620
...where the dark and foul ravaged me...

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:09.160
As the moon waxes

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:11.070
and wanes,

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.520
the curse grows stronger.

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.900
It's too painful...

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.930
Too lonely...

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.090
So...

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.230
Let's end this...

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.400
Ba'alskra...

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:32.760
I want to be with you 
until the very end.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:39.990
I want to choose who I 
spend my last moments with.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:44.330
And you choose that human.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.040
Yes.

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:50.810
You intend to die for that human?

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:52.630
That's right.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.630
You're making a mistake!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.450
Yes, I agree.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.470
But you see, Ba'alskra...

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.010
I truly...

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:07.940
I truly love Taito so much.

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:09.390
So much that I...

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:16.130
am willing to give up 
this eternal body...

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:23.990
Himea... Is this Ba'alskra 
guy controlling you?

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:26.880
What do I do?

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:30.250
How do I get him out of your body?

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.300
Don't be absurd, fool.

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.920
You're the one who stole 
her from me, human!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.150
She belongs to me.

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:54.490
The beautiful Saitohimea 
is mine and mine alone!

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:58.080
That's why I'll be taking her away...

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.070
To a world beyond your reach.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:09.370
A world you can never reach! 
A world for the two of us!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:10.410
Stop!

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:17.020
Taito... Run away...

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:21.460
Run away while I'm holding him back...

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:24.430
H-Hurry...

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.640
Himea?!

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.370
Ah, no... I'm losing control...

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:31.590
Hurry... Run!

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:35.700
If I run away, you'll be taken from 
me the way you were nine years ago!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.660
I won't run away by myself!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.700
Please, Taito...

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:41.650
Listen to me...

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.680
I can't keep you safe...

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.840
I don't want you to die!

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.430
If you die, I'll...

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:51.410
Himea?!

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:59.870
I promise... I promise to come save you!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:03.890
Dammit! Dammit! What's wrong with me?!

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:05.720
Why am I always so helpless?!

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:09.890
Saitohimea... You would sacrifice 
yourself for that scum...

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.150
Die, you eyesore!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:29.090
That's not enough to kill me!

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:39.750
Taito...

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:43.560
Sorry, Haruka. The student council 
president wants to see me.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.310
He said some urgent work came up.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:49.690
Thanks for the lunch. I'll eat it later.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:53.600
That's right. You're on 
the student council now.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.900
Y-Yeah!

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:56.600
I've missed you...

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:58.490
I've missed you so much.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.980
I guess there's nothing 
wrong with being mediocre.

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:03.900
Haruka.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:08.860
Contact List
Speed Dial

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.620
Kurogane Taito

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:35.850
Shigure Haruka

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.240
Haruka?

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:42.160
Ah, Taito? Do you have a moment?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.690
Uh, well... Now's not a good time...

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.190
Taito?!

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.440
Are you okay? Did something happen?

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.950
It's nothing. Don't worry.

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.200
Anyway, did you need something?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.060
Uh-huh...

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:57.950
Never mind.

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:00.570
You sound like you're busy.

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:01.470
Really?

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:04.540
Hey, Taito. I don't know what happened,

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:07.380
but don't push yourself too hard.

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.040
Don't you remember?

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.220
You know, back when you did karate?

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:14.650
You would keep challenging 
the older students.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:16.510
Until you were bruised all over.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.770
But I never ran away...

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.150
Hello? What's wrong? Taito...

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.340
What's wrong? Aren't 
you going to run away?

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:49.880
Yeah, I just remembered 
how I'm supposed to be.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:51.920
What do you mean...

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:56.470
I don't even know the meaning 
of the words "give up"!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:16:02.000
I just keep on struggling, until 
I'm victorious in the end.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.810
The end? You mean...

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:09.730
Like this?

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:16.560
I know that Himea's there.

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:19.470
And I'm gonna take her back!

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:23.230
Fifteen minutes have passed 
since your first death?

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.400
But does it even matter?

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:29.900
The fact remains that you are 
completely helpless before me.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.060
C-Can you hear me?

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:34.070
I know you can hear me, Himea...

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.140
I can't bring myself to 
ditch you and run away.

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.770
I mean, even if I manage to survive,

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.120
it won't matter if you're 
not there with me!

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:46.900
Don't worry. It won't take 
long to kill you seven times.

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:50.490
I'm pretty stupid.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:54.930
So I don't have any 
plans to fall back on.

00:16:56.830 --> 00:17:00.150
But I promise to always 
be by your side...

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:07.300
I am the one who is 
meant to be by her side.

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:12.420
How could a mindless, useless, and 
powerless wretch ever protect her?

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:17.120
That day, when Himea 
cast her spell on me...

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.510
We made a promise...

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.090
Don't you remember, Himea?

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:25.760
To be together in life and death!

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:29.670
Kurogane Taito...

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:32.050
I will never forgive you...

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:36.530
The repugnant, squirming insect...

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.610
...who has her love...

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.400
Himea...

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:43.680
Answer me...

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:47.460
Now, you've died five times.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.820
You only have one life remaining.

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.710
No more chances after that.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.590
That's all I need...

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.480
Right, Himea?

00:17:56.980 --> 00:18:00.930
Silence! You're the 
one who destroyed her!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:04.040
Her love for you drove 
her to choose death!

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:09.050
You're the reason she 
won't live much longer!

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.150
What are you talking about?

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:19.530
Protect her? Save her? 
Don't make me laugh!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.490
Don't make me laugh! 
Don't make me laugh!

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.860
You're the one who killed her!

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:26.530
She sacrificed her own 
life for you, you scum!

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:29.930
Taito...

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:35.000
Taito!

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:37.090
H-How...

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:41.150
Himea...

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:44.330
My life belongs to you...

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.410
You are my...!

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.600
And you are my...

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:17.120
Mmm, I love you too, Taito.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:28.020
I was born to protect you...

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:29.430
It was impossible.

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:32.670
You could never protect me.

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:35.760
Only Taito can.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.990
You were the one who created me.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:41.460
I was born so you wouldn't be

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:43.320
lonely...

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:46.180
But... But I was still lonely!

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:49.700
You couldn't fill the 
emptiness in my heart!

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:54.830
Taito was the only one who could 
fill the emptiness in my heart.

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:59.210
Taito was the only one 
who could find me.

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:02.160
The Seraphim come...

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:07.100
The Seraphim come to violate 
your powerless body!

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.460
That will be the end of it all!

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:13.360
You no longer have the 
power to defend yourself!

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:14.700
That's why you need my help!

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:15.230
Sorry...

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.850
Sorry, Ba'alskra...

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:23.470
If I'm allowed to be by Taito's side...

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:25.820
That's all...

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.210
...I need.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.180
I'm sorry...

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:34.560
Ba'alskra...

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:39.180
Good-bye...

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.760
Saitohimea...

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:48.820
Saitohimea...

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:50.640
Never forget...

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:55.590
Kurogane Taito can never protect you...

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:58.430
Only I can...

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.200
Taito...

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:07.930
Himea! It's you!

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:09.230
Uh-huh...

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:17.400
Hey, Taito...

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:20.430
Please...

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.710
Make love to me...

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:28.880
What are you saying...

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:34.230
Smother my body with your warmth...

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:41.270
What's wrong, Taito?

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.310
Make love to me.

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:23.940
So, is she awake?

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:24.630
Yes.

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:26.840
Everything is going according to plan?

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:27.510
Yes.

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:32.350
The ancient magician, Saitohimea..

00:23:32.350 --> 00:23:34.180
We must prevent her from

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:37.620
completing the secret spell of Rapture.

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:38.270
Yes.

00:23:38.630 --> 00:23:41.470
That is why you were made.

00:23:41.470 --> 00:23:42.510
And...

00:23:42.510 --> 00:23:43.630
I understand.

00:23:44.160 --> 00:23:45.000
Good.

00:23:45.720 --> 00:23:48.760
You are such an obedient girl.

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.200
Very well. You are excused.

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:55.410
Continue to monitor the situation.

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:56.620
Yes.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:01.660
It hurts, Taito...

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:04.160
Huh?

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:09.430
Why am I here?

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:13.440
Why are humans so annoying?

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:15.770
If every human besides 
Taito were to die,

00:24:15.770 --> 00:24:18.120
we could be all alone.

00:24:18.120 --> 00:24:20.430
Maybe I should use my 
magic to wipe them out.

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:23.290
But Taito might get mad.

00:24:23.790 --> 00:24:26.400
But I love it when he looks angry.

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:30.470
Wait, all this thinking 
about Taito got me excited.

00:24:30.470 --> 00:24:31.660
I think I'll kill them all.

00:24:31.660 --> 00:24:34.220
Because I want to be alone with Taito!

00:24:34.220 --> 00:24:35.630
It's killing time.

00:24:35.070 --> 00:24:39.910
Next Time "And the Seraphim is Sung"

00:24:35.630 --> 00:24:38.610
Prepare to die, filthy humans.
